" by code: numbers, texts, selection keys, record names and "
"`v['<code>__color']`) and `d` (pure drawing helpers: iso, pts, box, face, "
"flap, rect, line, dim_line, viewbox, stroke_width, shade, color, num). It "
"must return a whole <svg> element."
